{
  "title": "Oven Toasted British Tofu Welsh Rarebit",
  "description": "A rich and bouncy ovo-vegetarian friendly British dish featuring cilantro leaves, double fry KFC style tofu, and served in a lotus leaf wrap, inspired by traditional Welsh rarebit.",
