      "amount": "1/2 cup"
    },
    {
      "name": "cheese sauce",
      "amount": "1 cup",
      "notes": "store bought or homemade"
    },
    {
      "name": "paprika",
      "amount": "1 tsp"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Cut the tofu into small cubes and coat with flour, cornstarch, and paprika.",
    "Double fry the tofu cubes in hot oil until golden brown.",
    "Drain the fried tofu on paper towels.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix the cheese sauce and chopped cilantro leaves.",
    "Place a few pieces of fried tofu on each lotus leaf.",
    "Spoon the cheese and cilantro mixture over the tofu.",
    "Fold the lotus leaves to enclose the filling.",
    "Bake the filled lotus leaves in the preheated oven for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
